wiki/Deeper%20Banuta\">Deeper Banuta</a> (<a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32741,32556,12\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (32741, 32556, 12)</a>), <a href=\"#/wiki/Hero%20Cave\">Hero Cave</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Hot%20Spot\">Hot Spot</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Fury%20Dungeon\">Fury Dungeon</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-behaviour\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Behaviour\">Behaviour</span></h3>\n<p>\tFollows target, fights until the death.<br/><br/>A massive fire elemental attacks in melee range.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div class=\"history-section\" id=\"w-creature-history\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-History\">History</span></h3>\n<ul><li>As of <a href=\"#/wiki/Updates%2F9.60\">Summer Update 2012</a> this creature started to drop loot. This was based on player input in the test server forums, when discussing the profitability of the new added hunting area, <a href=\"#/wiki/Hot%20Spot\">Hot Spot</a>.</li>\n<li>You can no longer convince Massive Fire Elementals as of Patch 10.13 (previously it took 690 mana).</li>\n<li>As announced on March 04, 2025, the patch added a \"semi-rare\" chance of looting <a href=\"#/wiki/Might%20Ring\">Might Ring</a> from this creature.</li></ul>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Loot\">Loot</span></h3>\n<p><small><i>Drop rates are estimated based on 1,763 samples <span class=\"loot-stats-link\">(Loot Statistics)</span>.</i></small> <small><i>Colour-coding is applied after 500 samples.</i></small><br/><small><i>Task column indicates items used in delivery tasks.</i></small>\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable\" style=\"text-align:center; width:auto;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th></th>\n<th>Item</th>\n<th>Task</th>\n<th>Quantity</th>\n<th>Avg</th>\n<th data-sort-type=\"number\">%\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"loot-table-icon\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a hre